  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improve access to inputs and markets for biofortified seeds and food products. Generate demand for these nutrient rich staple crops using a demand creation approach that taps into the rational and emitional drives of consumers choices for nutrient rich staples, improve the enabling environmenr for biofortified seeds and food products through advocacy, catalytic financif, and technology licencing services</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Verbesserter Zugang zu biofortifiziertem Saatgt und Nahrungsmitteln, Erh&#xf6;hung der Nachfrage nach n&#xe4;hrstoffreichen Nahrungsmitteln, Verbesserung der Rahmenbedingungen f&#xfc;r biofortifizierte Produkte</narrative>
  </description>
